{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54286","headline":"寄题海陵离亭 · 高蟾","name":"寄题海陵离亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"银根菡萏连天落，玉穗蒹葭动地飞。\n荡桨先生曾寄梦，凭轩公司合忘机。\n江村白鸟和云没，泽国寒蝉带雨微。\n何似高秋钓台上，一声清啸送僧归。\n（同前第三四八六页）（按：《诗渊》第三册第二一六八页收《若耶溪》、第五册第三一七七收《越州新楼》、第三四○五页收《忆题惠山寺书堂》，皆署高蟾名，经查均应爲李绅诗。\n前录二诗，颇疑亦李绅所作。\n今仍收高蟾名下，俟考详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}